function portButton(node,port,direction){const b=button('',()=>{if(skipPortClick){skipPortClick=false;return;}if(pendingPort&&pendingPort.direction!==direction){const source=direction==='in'?pendingPort.nodeId:node.id,target=direction==='in'?node.id:pendingPort.nodeId,p=direction==='in'?port:pendingPort.port;connect(source,target,p);}else{pendingPort={nodeId:node.id,port,direction};connectionMessage('已选择'+(direction==='out'?'输出':'输入')+'，请选择另一端口；Esc 取消。');}});b.className='orbit-port';b.dataset.node=node.id;b.dataset.port=port;b.dataset.direction=direction;b.setAttribute('aria-label',(node.label||G.types[node.type]?.label||node.type)+(direction==='out'?' 输出':' 输入 '+port));b.onpointerdown=e=>{if(e.button!==0)return;e.stopPropagation();skipPortClick=false;gesture={type:'wire',port:{nodeId:node.id,port,direction},start:[e.clientX,e.clientY],moved:false};};return b;}
